-### Parameters
-*   **Quantization Scheme:** 16-bit encoding for normals [S3].
-*   **Interpolation:** Nearest-neighbor for shading texture [S2, S3].
-*   **Threshold for ERT:** Typically 0.95 or 1.0 [Parent].
